    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολάν</span></b>  (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοάν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: ἀντὶ τοῦ δήν,</span>
