			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολάνα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστροπός,</span> Id. (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολομάν</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολβαί:</span></b> 
